sections.append('<p>Prefer extreme effects within roughly ten points and review effects beyond fifteen, relative to each context’s own baseline. A naturally dominant club is not capped at 60% or 65%; those absolute references concern near-balanced controls. No zero-loss finite sample establishes invincibility. The earlier hot/favorable confirmation (+8.01 points, interval +6.12 to +9.89) remains separate; the new screen uses different clubs/pairings/tactics and does not isolate a coefficient change.</p>')
